OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FA wet start with some heavy
OL,6,Frain around, though brightening up
OL,7,Ffrom the northwest through the morning
OL,8,Fto leave a fine afternoon. Breezy, and
OL,9,Ffeeling fresher than recently.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FMostly
OL,12,Ffine over the weekend with some
OL,13,Fsunshine. Turning windy on Sunday,
OL,14,Fthough quite warm. Rain overnight,
OL,15,Fclearing to another mostly fine day on
OL,16,FMonday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
